 "notes": "Zero-coupon bond repaying 100 on 1 January of its maturity year. price = 100 discounted at the zero-coupon yield for the remaining time; no income. extra.yield = yearly return if held to maturity; extra.years = years left. A stylisation: such bonds were not sold to the public before 1982.",
